{"id":"n66091-3-5","stage":5,"title":"싸늘하다 · 冷丝丝","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66091-3-5-1","ko":"아까 승규가 해 준 귀신 이야기 정말 무섭지?","zh":"刚才承奎讲的鬼故事真的好可怕吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"준","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준","audio":"/audio/380bd5afbff5e69e5943.mp3"}},{"text":"귀신","meaning":"鬼，鬼魂","explanation":"귀신：鬼，鬼魂","readings":[{"term":"귀신","audio":"/audio/b88f6786ac78a87de54c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36872","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀신","audio":"/audio/b88f6786ac78a87de54c.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기","meaning":"故事","explanation":"이야기：故事","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"1","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"무섭지?","meaning":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","explanation":"무섭다：可怕，恐怖，畏惧；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"2","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무섭지","audio":"/audio/c1eb4dab6c4413c59d4e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"b88f6786ac78a87d","term":"귀신","zh":"鬼，鬼魂","audio":"/audio/b88f6786ac78a87de54c.mp3","entryId":"36872","definition":"人死后留下的灵魂。","pronunciation":["귀ː신"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"故事","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"说或写给别人的关于某个事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等的话或文章。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"难以面对或想逃避某个人或某种状况。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3800681dd7534a18fe33.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66091-3-5-2","ko":"응, 듣는데 등골이 싸늘하더라.","zh":"嗯，听着的时候背脊都凉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","